OL,3,GNEWSAOmagh inquiry hears of police
OL,4,Ainvestigation 'shortcomings'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice investigations into the Omagh
OL,7,Fbombing did not follow guidelines and
OL,8,F"shortcomings" in the inputting of data
OL,9,Fmay have lead to "missed
OL,10,Fopportunities", the inquiry into the
OL,11,Fexplosion has heard.
OL,13,FTwenty-nine people, including a woman
OL,14,Fpregnant with twins, died in the Real
OL,15,FIRA bombing in the County Tyrone town
OL,16,Fon 15 August 1998 - the biggest single
OL,17,Fatrocity in the Troubles.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
