OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAOmagh inquiry hears of police
OL,4,Ainvestigation 'shortcomings'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Ch Insp Neil McGuinness from the
OL,7,FPolice Service of Northern Ireland was
OL,8,Fquestioned about the systems in place
OL,9,Fat the time of the bombing for managing
OL,10,Finvestigation data during the inquiry
OL,11,Fon Tuesday.
OL,13,FHe said the usefulness of the database
OL,14,Fwas limited by lack of training in the
OL,15,FRoyal Ulster Constabulary (RUC).
